<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>EXPLANATORY NOTE</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This Amendment No. 1 on Form 6-K/A (&ldquo;Amendment
No. 1&rdquo;) amends the current report on Form 6-K originally furnished by Yimutian Inc. (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) to the Securities and
Exchange Commission on September 24, 2026 (the &ldquo;Original Form 6-K&rdquo;). The Company is furnishing this Amendment No. 1 solely for
the purpose of including Exhibit 10.1 to the Original Form 6-K.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Except as described above, this Amendment No.
1 does not amend, modify or update any other information or disclosures set forth in the Original Form 6-K.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>


